'''Master Uril''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]]. He can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after beating [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 50|Floor 50]] of the [[Heavenly Tower]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]] improves health, damage, range and recharge time, while also gaining [[Behemoth Slayer]], [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]], [[Strong Against]], [[Curse]] and an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] target.

